VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'can see that it has become much more refined. And&nbsp; they also allow you to use the seed VR2 upscaler&nbsp;&nbsp; which I think is a much better model than the&nbsp; RTX upscaler. So if you want to run that, you can&nbsp;&nbsp; install that locally through Simply Genen and use&nbsp; the seed VR2 upscaler. Now let\'s say that you have&nbsp;&nbsp;'

