[11:00] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'that it\'s built right into Simply Genen. So, now&nbsp; I\'m going to show you guys how you can make videos&nbsp;&nbsp; with the character that you\'ve created inside of&nbsp; Simply Genen. So, the first step is obviously to&nbsp;&nbsp; generate a base image. So, this is the base image&nbsp; that we\'re going to use just her in the gym. And&nbsp;&nbsp;'

