[11:26] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'where we can then describe the action, the pose,&nbsp; and what\'s going on inside of the video. There\'s&nbsp;&nbsp; also an option here for character dialogue. And I&nbsp; will show you guys exactly how you can use this.&nbsp;&nbsp; So the first step is to obviously create&nbsp; a good prompt. The better your prompt is,&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[11:40] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
