VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'for the dialogue when she notices that she\'s&nbsp; being recorded by her friend is just going to be,&nbsp;&nbsp; "Oh my god, hi." We can also select the delivery&nbsp; here from this drop down list. So, we\'re going to&nbsp;&nbsp; select dramatic. Moving down towards the bottom,&nbsp; we can see here the aspect ratio. We can see that&nbsp;&nbsp;'

