[12:21] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'to select in this timing. Now, once we have all of&nbsp; that set up, we can just generate. All right. So,&nbsp;&nbsp; our video has just generated. Let\'s&nbsp; check out the result. Oh my god. Hi. All right. So, looking back on it, I probably&nbsp; should have prompted that there were some like&nbsp;&nbsp;'

