VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'natural gym noises in the background. It\'s kind&nbsp; of just a skill issue. LTX 2.3 really is a great&nbsp;&nbsp; model and it\'s probably the best local model&nbsp; that you can run. And it really just comes down&nbsp;&nbsp; to upping your prompting game and learning how to&nbsp; prompt things that will make for better videos.&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[12:54] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'But with a few adjustments, this video would&nbsp; be ready to be posted on Instagram right out&nbsp;&nbsp; of the box. It\'s really just a skill issue at the&nbsp; end of the day. I promise if you get really good&nbsp;&nbsp; at prompting, you can make crazy stuff with LTX&nbsp; 2.3. Now, before we wrap up, I just want to go&nbsp;&nbsp;'

