VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'over again just how much is packed into this thing&nbsp; beyond what we\'ve covered. In the preset store,&nbsp;&nbsp; video tab alone, you\'ve got access to a huge&nbsp; range of models, LTX 2.3, and multiple variants,&nbsp;&nbsp; including a low VRAM version and a GGUF version&nbsp; for older cards. You have one 2.2 for text to&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[13:22] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'video, one animate, which drives your character&nbsp; using motion from a reference video, otherwise&nbsp;&nbsp; known as motion control. And there\'s even a lip&nbsp; sync preset that takes a portrait and audio clip&nbsp;&nbsp; and syncs it up. And we have additional options&nbsp; for LTX, for low VRAMm with NSFW support included.&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[13:37] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'And it\'s not just characters that you can create&nbsp; with Simply Genen. There\'s a whole product library&nbsp;&nbsp; where you can save reusable product assets and&nbsp; a product studio built specifically around them.&nbsp;&nbsp; In the preset store, the product recipes tab has&nbsp; ready-made setups like a 180°ree product reveal,&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[13:51] [scene:talk]
