[14:06] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'this isn\'t just a face generator. It\'s built to&nbsp; handle the entire pipeline. And that\'s genuinely&nbsp;&nbsp; the whole point of this app. It\'s not just one&nbsp; trick. It\'s a packaged version of a full Comfy UI&nbsp;&nbsp; production pipeline. Characters, products, video&nbsp; upscaling, all in one place with a fraction of&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[14:20] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the setup. If you want to check out Simply Gen,&nbsp; the link is in the description below. Again,&nbsp;&nbsp; it\'s a onetime purchase, no subscription,&nbsp; and lifetime updates are included. I couldn\'t&nbsp;&nbsp; recommend this application enough. And if you end&nbsp; up trying it out, let me know what you make with'
